                <l xml:id="m-ff0a03dd-ea34-4da2-a21e-f6a25d206652" facs="#m-c3206c1d-7db8-4750-bf96-f4904b149836" label="text-like">Sunday at Terce.</l><l xml:id="m-725dea8d-a79d-455e-a7a7-1161edee6101" facs="#m-155b6427-079d-486c-96bd-a1b5788d5d1f" label="ambiguous">238</l><l xml:id="m-81e92413-d02f-4a7b-bcf4-e96a465593a5" facs="#m-ec036c7b-d066-49b4-943d-688889cb3b8c" label="lyrics-like">In testimó-ni-a</l><l xml:id="m-d175e03d-27a0-4817-b6cc-340b779f5ed8" facs="#m-0fc0eda5-ba13-4f87-aac2-332a506d67f9" label="lyrics-like">ni-tá-tem: in ví-a tú-a viví-fi-ca me.</l><l xml:id="m-7e14685d-7323-4434-9076-cbe015293f28" facs="#m-0144b110-70c0-4a29-a61a-65e61a5680d9" label="lyrics-like">tú-a. V. Gló-ri-a Pátri,</l><l xml:id="m-5b47a72d-2dd7-4dff-8552-4f1b531e789f" facs="#m-8a8eabb8-8486-4e2e-9544-c65c49cbeba0" label="ambiguous">et Fi-li-o,</l><l xml:id="m-4f4e370c-9088-4cae-8f63-1bd97c9cf35e" facs="#m-d81bb0e4-f8eb-44b8-ba61-192bdea76c18" label="lyrics-like">et Spi-rí-tu-i Sán¬</l><l xml:id="m-9adf7244-9d31-4268-bdbe-821fca80e3a2" facs="#m-4b760cc2-b957-4824-9464-8696157ed7a8" label="lyrics-like">Inclína.</l><l xml:id="m-ed49ff34-d1bf-4458-bdd7-59b350e26f9e" facs="#m-899f7c1c-ca53-4f76-b72f-2ff8bd2e6ecc" label="ambiguous">cto.</l><l xml:id="m-43f0f449-4c0b-4032-b005-1cd49a01cf21" facs="#m-37c92517-51fe-45be-8b3e-f5d1db74c8a3" label="lyrics-like">V. Ego díxi: Dómine mi-seré-re mé-i. (Another Chant, p.118.)</l><l xml:id="m-eaf48cd4-1305-430d-9883-9cc0132527e3" facs="#m-8a0d8780-b98e-45e8-87ac-c0650f3470d4" label="lyrics-like">K. Sána ánimam méam, quia peccávi tibi.</l><l xml:id="m-bd6c3f10-853c-400a-84ea-4c83c5079f41" facs="#m-8fe56d5b-2b14-4e0c-994d-1458215cc252" label="text-like">During Advent. Antiphon and Chapter are found in the Proper ot</l><l xml:id="m-cc808056-cdc4-4245-9a64-96d7513dfd72" facs="#m-06eacde0-da3c-4e5d-b1e0-a9dda466530a" label="text-like">the Time.</l><l xml:id="m-acd31d38-901a-4946-b3a5-dafdd5a2beb9" facs="#m-16f1d5ce-b97f-4bd2-9e23-118a029dea0f" label="ambiguous">short</l><l xml:id="m-a3968fab-400d-4880-a5b8-870c92782992" facs="#m-f380b1be-7a5f-410b-9106-46e0d6af555a" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-bc90cd19-8d87-402e-86db-2ec6d873d651" facs="#m-2fe6182b-d276-4c7e-af14-65a607b1757d" label="lyrics-like">Eni ad libe-rándum nos, “Dómine Dé-us virtú¬</l><l xml:id="m-78762e9d-e608-4979-8301-c45b648a1095" facs="#m-88e95204-c907-4c66-b25f-cfa083875aac" label="ambiguous">A</l><l xml:id="m-f2c75d92-e5d1-4f14-b89e-f0c7cf2b846e" facs="#m-32e6d7f6-92d0-40d5-8956-d5e4ab432729" label="lyrics-like">tum. V. Osténde fáci-em tú-am, et sálvi érimus. Gló¬</l><l xml:id="m-409650fc-81e8-4c1d-b040-72a9680b357b" facs="#m-5d389dc8-6657-40c8-9be1-59c20f0ecf04" label="lyrics-like">ri-a Pátri, et Fi-li-o, et Spi-rí-tu-i Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-c889749b-ea29-418b-a5da-8f26fb36fa2d" facs="#m-aaa811a4-3e35-4e57-a560-bcc2b22ccb02" label="lyrics-like">V. Timébunt géntes nómen túum Dómine.</l><l xml:id="m-039a5836-73c5-4db6-98e2-dd05a380bd0a" facs="#m-254d85a8-8e4f-4184-bfbd-ae7b30536006" label="lyrics-like">R. Et ómnes réges térrae glóriam túam.</l><l xml:id="m-c151b815-5fde-492d-b546-aa0c9bacef4d" facs="#m-7980b149-229c-498b-ab1a-d443a5b3fe8e" label="text-like">During Lent. Antiphon and Chapter are found in the Proper of the Time.</l><l xml:id="m-22720fe8-f9f9-4c95-9a0b-5afbe76e45b7" facs="#m-3346856f-35dc-4518-9da0-63a8ee4bc6d3" label="ambiguous">short</l><l xml:id="m-ad67e5e0-f4dc-4f0e-9024-371629f06381" facs="#m-03c8335b-266e-4358-9040-9f87c7d65394" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-98dcc53c-7fcd-4e2d-a1fe-0b773d7be4f0" facs="#m-347cb07b-24f8-44db-92d3-ee143a359688" label="ambiguous">I</l><l xml:id="m-c7c65c36-db04-41e5-9040-2b2f6fbaaaf4" facs="#m-c8370d13-4d73-47bb-8032-9b1b4e0bcd12" label="lyrics-like">liberávit me“De láque-o venánti-um. V. Et</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>